  "authors": [],
  "body": {
    "comment": "I vote NO on this proposal. Supporting open-source maintainers matters, and this revised one-year plan is an improvement. But it would give 4.094 million ADA to one administrator, while the councils can only advise and cannot stop payments. It also overlaps with Intersect's existing POSM programmes. I would rather support a smaller, clearly scoped plan with shared control and clear milestones."
  },
  "hashAlgorithm": "blake2b-256"
}